                    <section id="tab1" class="panel active fade-in" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="t1">
                        <h3 class="fadeInUp animatable">Paediatric Urology</h3>
                        <p class="fadeInUp animatable">At our Paediatric Urology Department, we provide specialised care for disorders affecting the kidneys, bladder, ureters and genital tract in children&mdash;from newborns to adolescents. Combining advanced surgical expertise with child-friendly, compassionate care, our team ensures accurate diagnosis, minimally invasive treatment and long-term support for every young patient and their family.</p>
                        <p class="pt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Our Specialised Services Include:</p>
                        
                        <div class="workup-sec mt-3">
                            <h4 class="py-3 fadeInUp animatable">Diagnostic Work Up</h4>
                            <ul class="listing-apps">
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable first_class">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Ultrasound and Doppler Studies</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>High-resolution imaging to assess structural abnormalities of the kidneys, bladder and urinary tract, including obstruction, hydronephrosis and congenital anomalies.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Micturating Cystourethrogram (MCUG)</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>A dynamic X-ray study to evaluate vesicoureteric reflux (VUR), posterior urethral valves (PUV), bladder function and urethral abnormalities.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div>
                                        <h5>Urodynamic Studies</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Comprehensive evaluation of bladder storage and emptying functions to diagnose conditions such as overactive bladder, dysfunctional voiding, neurogenic bladder and incontinence.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Cystoscopy</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Endoscopic examination of the bladder and urethra to assess structural anomalies, remove urethral valves, manage strictures and diagnose recurrent urinary problems.</p>
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Interventional and Advanced Management</h4>
                            <ul class="listing-apps">
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Minimally Invasive Surgery (MIS)</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Laparoscopic and endoscopic procedures for conditions such as ureteropelvic junction obstruction, undescended testes, hernias and varicoceles, ensuring quicker recovery and reduced discomfort.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div>
                                        <h5>Management of Vesicoureteric Reflux (VUR)</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>From medical therapy to endoscopic correction and surgical reimplantation, tailored treatment to prevent recurrent infections and preserve kidney function.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Hypospadias and Genital Reconstruction Surgery</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Comprehensive evaluation and surgical correction of hypospadias, chordee and other penile abnormalities using modern, child-safe surgical techniques.</p>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Paediatric Stone Disease Management</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Minimally invasive treatments, including ureteroscopy, laser lithotripsy and percutaneous procedures for kidney and ureteric stones, with post-procedure metabolic evaluation.</p>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Posterior Urethral Valve (PUV) Management</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Early diagnosis and endoscopic ablation of PUV to prevent kidney damage, along with long-term monitoring of bladder and renal health.</p>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Antenatal and Neonatal Urology</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Evaluation and management of abnormalities detected during pregnancy, such as hydronephrosis, duplex systems and obstructive uropathies, with coordinated neonatal care plans.</p>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Reconstructive Urology</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <p>Surgical solutions for complex conditions, including bladder exstrophy&ndash;epispadias complex, ureteric anomalies, neurogenic bladder and traumatic injuries.</p>
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animatable">Medical Management and Specialised Clinics</h4>
                            <ul class="listing-apps">
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Urinary Tract Infections (UTIs)</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Evaluation and long-term management of recurrent UTIs, including imaging, antibiotic prophylaxis when required and correction of underlying anatomical causes.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Bladder Dysfunction and Enuresis Clinics</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Specialised care for daytime wetting, nocturnal enuresis, overactive bladder and bowel&ndash;bladder dysfunction through urotherapy, behavioural interventions and medication.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Undescended Testes (Cryptorchidism)</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Diagnosis, hormonal evaluation when indicated and timely surgical correction (orchidopexy) to ensure normal development and reduce long-term risks.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Disorders of Sex Development (DSD)</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Multidisciplinary care involving endocrinology, genetics and counselling for conditions affecting sexual differentiation, ensuring holistic support for children and families.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable speciality_banner_no">
                                    <img class="img-fluid speciality_banner" src="/upload/fileManager/specialise_banner/PaediatricUrology.png" alt="Paediatric Urology Speciality Banner" />
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Neurogenic Bladder Care</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Comprehensive management for children with spinal dysraphism, cerebral palsy and other neurological conditions affecting bladder function. Includes clean intermittent catheterisation (CIC), medication and long-term surveillance.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                                <li class="fadeInUp animatable">
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <h5>Adolescent Urology</h5>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="mb-2">
                                        <p>Specialised services addressing puberty-related urological issues, including varicocele, testicular pain, voiding disorders and sexually acquired conditions, with privacy and sensitivity.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </li>
                            </ul>

                            <h4 class="py-3 mt-4 fadeInUp animated">Rehabilitation, Follow-Up and Family Support</h4>
                            <p class="fadeInUp animated">We offer ongoing follow-up programmes focused on bladder training, continence improvement, renal preservation and healthy development. Our multidisciplinary approach ensures coordinated support from urologists, nephrologists, physiotherapists, psychologists and continence nurses&mdash;helping children achieve the best possible long-term outcomes.</p>
                        </div>

